 @marty5300  „crazy big jump“ 😂 You literally said fake frame how can you call it crazy? Its a similar tech fucking Tvs use. In fact they could even do it more aggressive and render 2 frames in between, the frame count would be even higher BUT that doesn’t matter! 

When people go for high fps the frame counter is just a by product, the initial goal is to get lower latency (higher fps = lower latency). Nvidias bs tech DOESNT do that, you get high fps but your latency stays more or less the same.

There is absolutely nothing „crazy“ about it

